          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbfdff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#0f766e;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(15,118,110,0.06);--max:1100px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#0f172a;line-height:1.45;font-family:var(--font)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:48px auto;padding:0 20px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em}\\n    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(12,12,12,0.04)}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}\\n    h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 10px}\\n    p{margin:0 0 12px;color:#152033}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:var(--glass);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent)}\\n    ul.facts{padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0 0}\\n    .svgs{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .muted-block{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);background:transparent;margin-top:18px}\\n    .section{margin-bottom:22px}\\n    .case{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbffff);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,103,94,0.04);margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .myth-true{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .myth, .truth{padding:12px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .myth{background:#fff6f6;border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,0.06);color:#7b1d1d}\\n    .truth{background:#f6fffb;border:1px solid rgba(6,95,70,0.06);color:#07332f}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div class='brand'>\\n        <svg width='56' height='56' viewBox='0 0 56 56' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\\n          <rect rx='10' width='56' height='56' fill='#e6fffb'></rect>\\n          <path d='M14 36c8-8 18-12 26-18' stroke='#0f766e' stroke-width='3' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'></path>\\n        </svg>\\n        <div class='logo'>\\n          <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class='meta'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n        <a href='specialties.html'>Specialties</a>\\n        <a href='approach.html'>How I Work</a>\\n        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n        <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class='grid'>\\n      <section>\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <div style='display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px'>\\n            <div>\\n              <h1>About {{THERAPIST_NAME}}</h1>\\n              <div class='meta'>Licensed {{LICENSE}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style='text-align:right'>\\n              <div class='pill'>Accepting new clients</div>\\n              <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='section'>\\n            <h2>Clinical orientation and what I offer</h2>\\n            <p>I integrate evidence-informed approaches to support people facing anxiety, trauma reactions, relationship strain, burnout, and life transitions. My work is collaborative: we clarify goals, try methods in-session, and test what changes in daily life. I do not provide medical care; I coordinate with prescribers when needed.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='section'>\\n            <h2>Foundational values</h2>\\n            <div class='myth-true'>\\n              <div class='myth'>\\n                <strong>Therapy is a quick fix.</strong>\\n                <p class='meta'>Myth</p>\\n                <p>Meaningful change often takes time and structured practice between sessions.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class='truth'>\\n                <strong>Care is a guided process.</strong>\\n                <p class='meta'>Reality</p>\\n                <p>I use measurable steps, feedback, and compassionate accountability so progress is visible and respectful of your pace.</p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='section'>\\n            <h2>Core pillars of my practice</h2>\\n            <ul class='facts'>\\n              <li>Assessment & shared formulation: clear goals and expected steps</li>\\n              <li>Skills-based work: emotion regulation, exposure, communication practice</li>\\n              <li>Contextual focus: home, work, relationships considered together</li>\\n              <li>Privacy & clarity: explicit confidentiality and limits are discussed at intake</li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='section'>\\n            <h2>Anonymized case snapshots</h2>\\n            <div class='case'>\\n              <strong>Mid-career burnout</strong>\\n              <p class='meta'>Goal-oriented work over 12 sessions — outcome: improved boundaries, return to valued activities.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class='case'>\\n              <strong>Relationship distress</strong>\\n              <p class='meta'>Joint-focused techniques and individual processing — outcome: clearer communication and decision-making.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='section'>\\n            <h2>Practical details & limits</h2>\\n            <p class='muted-block'>Sessions are typically 50 minutes. I maintain strict confidentiality except where there is imminent risk of harm, abuse, or by legal mandate. If you are in crisis or immediate danger, call local emergency services or your crisis line. Telehealth is available when clinically appropriate.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class='section'>\\n            <h2>Frequently asked</h2>\\n            <p><strong>Do you accept insurance?</strong> I provide superbills; clients may seek reimbursement through their insurer. I can discuss options during intake.</p>\\n            <p><strong>How soon can I start?</strong> Scheduling varies; reach out via {{EMAIL}} or phone at {{PHONE}} for current availability.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px'>\\n            <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>Book an intake</a>\\n            <a href='contact.html' style='color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;'>Contact</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <div style='text-align:center'>\\n            <svg width='96' height='96' viewBox='0 0 96 96' aria-hidden='true'>\\n              <circle cx='48' cy='32' r='20' fill='#f0fffb'></circle>\\n              <rect x='16' y='58' width='64' height='20' rx='6' fill='#e9fffb'></rect>\\n              <path d='M24 66c12-8 36-8 48 0' stroke='#0f766e' stroke-width='2' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'></path>\\n            </svg>\\n            <div style='margin-top:8px;font-weight:600'>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div class='meta'>{{LICENSE}}</div>\\n            <div style='margin-top:8px'>\\n              <div class='meta'>Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <hr style='border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(12,12,12,0.04);margin:14px 0'>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <h2 style='font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px'>How to begin</h2>\\n            <p class='meta'>Reach out by phone or email. A brief consult call clarifies fit and next steps.</p>\\n            <div style='margin-top:10px'>\\n              <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='display:block;text-align:center'>Start a consult</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>\\n            Privacy & scope: Notes are kept in encrypted records. Therapy supports emotional and behavioral health; it is not a substitute for emergency or medical services.\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class='card' style='margin-top:16px'>\\n          <h2 style='font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px'>Quick beliefs I hold</h2>\\n          <ul class='facts'>\\n            <li>Therapy is informed by data and tempered by human context.</li>\\n            <li>Respect for autonomy and cultural life is essential.</li>\\n            <li>We measure what matters: function, relationships, well-being.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>\\n        <div class='meta'>© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Confidential care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div class='meta'>Questions? {{PHONE}} • {{EMAIL}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>Areas of Focus — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--muted:#5b6170;--accent:#0b6b61;--card:#fbffff;--max:1100px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Roboto,Arial}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#071728}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;align-items:center}\\n    .intro{padding:20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbfffe);border-radius:12px}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    .pill{background:rgba(11,107,97,0.06);color:var(--accent);display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .spec{background:var(--card);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(6,23,24,0.04)}\\n    .spec h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px}\\n    .spec p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .aside{background:#f8fffc;border-radius:12px;padding:14px}\\n    .faq-item{margin-bottom:10px}\\n    .price{font-weight:700;color:#072b27}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'>\\n        <svg width='48' height='48' viewBox='0 0 48 48' aria-hidden='true'>\\n          <rect width='48' height='48' rx='8' fill='#f0fffb'></rect>\\n          <path d='M12 34c8-12 24-12 28-18' stroke='#0b6b61' stroke-width='3' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'></path>\\n        </svg>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n        <a href='about.html'>About</a>\\n        <a href='approach.html'>Approach</a>\\n        <a href='fees.html'>Fees</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class='hero'>\\n      <div class='intro card'>\\n        <div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>\\n          <div>\\n            <h1>Areas of focus</h1>\\n            <div class='pill' style='margin-top:8px'>Evidence-informed care</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style='text-align:right'>\\n            <div class='meta' style='color:var(--muted)'>Clinician: {{THERAPIST_NAME}}</div>\\n            <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='margin-top:10px;display:inline-block'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <p style='margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)'>I work with adults across a range of concerns. My practice emphasizes measurable goals and skills you can use between sessions.</p>\\n\\n        <div class='grid' aria-hidden='false'>\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Anxiety & worry</h3>\\n            <p>Targeted strategies: behavioral experiments, acceptance-based skills, and exposure work to reduce interference with daily life.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Trauma-related distress</h3>\\n            <p>Careful stabilization, paced processing, and safety-focused planning. We tailor pacing to your readiness.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Relationship patterns</h3>\\n            <p>Communication practice, boundary-setting, and repair strategies to support healthier interactions.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Life transitions & identity</h3>\\n            <p>Meaning-centered work to navigate career shifts, parenting changes, and emerging adulthood challenges.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Work-related burnout</h3>\\n            <p>Assessment of role-fit, workload, and restoration skills tied to behavioral change at work and home.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class='spec'>\\n            <h3>Mood & low motivation</h3>\\n            <p>Behavioral activation, schedule structuring, and collaborative problem-solving to reclaim momentum.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class='aside'>\\n        <svg width='120' height='80' viewBox='0 0 120 80' aria-hidden='true'>\\n          <rect width='120' height='80' rx='12' fill='#f6fffb'></rect>\\n          <circle cx='36' cy='36' r='14' fill='#e8fff8'></circle>\\n          <path d='M60 50c14-10 40-16 48-32' stroke='#0b6b61' stroke-width='2' fill='none'></path>\\n        </svg>\\n        <h2 style='font-size:16px;margin-top:12px'>How I frame care</h2>\\n        <p class='meta'>I prioritize measurable steps and shared decisions. Every plan includes skill-practice and periodic reviews so we know what is helping.</p>\\n\\n        <h3 style='font-size:14px;margin-top:12px'>Program options</h3>\\n        <p class='meta'>Rather than long open-ended therapy by default, I offer two common paths to clarify expectations:</p>\\n        <ul style='padding-left:18px;margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)'>\\n          <li><strong>Short Path</strong> — 8 structured sessions focused on symptom-targeted work and skills practice.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Exploratory Path</strong> — Flexible weekly sessions for ongoing life and relational work.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n\\n        <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n          <a class='cta' href='book.html'>Check availability</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <hr style='border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,107,97,0.06);margin:12px 0'>\\n        <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Session fees are paid at time of service. I provide receipts for insurance reimbursement when requested.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:18px'>\\n      <div class='card'>\\n        <h2 style='font-size:18px;margin:0 0 10px'>Illustrative case examples</h2>\\n        <div style='margin-bottom:8px'>\\n          <strong>Social anxiety — short path</strong>\\n          <p class='meta'>Focused 8-session plan using graded exposures and social skills practice; client reported reduced avoidance and more consistent engagement at work after three months.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style='margin-bottom:8px'>\\n          <strong>Complex grief — exploratory path</strong>\\n          <p class='meta'>A longer trajectory with meaning-based interventions and pacing; emphasis on affect regulation and ritualized processing.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class='card'>\\n        <h3 style='margin:0 0 6px'>Quick FAQ</h3>\\n        <div class='faq-item'>\\n          <strong>Are services remote?</strong>\\n          <p class='meta'>Telehealth is standard; in-person availability depends on location and scheduling.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='faq-item'>\\n          <strong>Do you do couples work?</strong>\\n          <p class='meta'>I focus primarily on individual therapy but collaborate with partners in goal-focused sessions when clinically appropriate.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class='faq-item'>\\n          <strong>How do you measure progress?</strong>\\n          <p class='meta'>We use brief self-report check-ins and goal reviews every 4–6 sessions to ensure alignment.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style='margin-top:22px'>\\n      <div class='card'>\\n        <h2 style='font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px'>Accessibility & privacy</h2>\\n        <p class='meta'>I aim to provide a respectful and accessible environment. Records are stored securely and discussed in consent. If you require accommodations, please mention them when contacting the practice.</p>\\n        <p class='meta' style='margin-top:8px;font-size:13px'>Crisis note: If you are in immediate danger or experiencing a medical emergency, call emergency services or your local crisis line. This practice does not provide emergency services.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style='margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between'>\\n      <div>© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div>{{PHONE}} • {{EMAIL}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset='utf-8'>\\n  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>\\n  <title>How I Work — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f7f9fa;--muted:#5a6270;--accent:#075e55;--card:#ffffff;--max:1050px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Roboto,Arial}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#0b1720}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:36px auto;padding:0 18px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .lead{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center}\\n    .lead .text{max-width:680px}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(11,22,22,0.04)}\\n    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .step{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fbffff;border:1px solid rgba(7,94,85,0.04)}\\n    .programs{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .plan{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#f6fffc)}\\n    .price{font-size:20px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\\n    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <header>\\n      <div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'>\\n        <svg width='44' height='44' viewBox='0 0 44 44' aria-hidden='true'>\\n          <rect width='44' height='44' rx='9' fill='#f2fffb'></rect>\\n          <path d='M10 30c6-10 18-14 28-20' stroke='#075e55' stroke-width='3' fill='none'></path>\\n        </svg>\\n        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href='index.html'>Home</a>\\n        <a href='specialties.html'>Paths</a>\\n        <a href='about.html'>Who I Am</a>\\n        <a href='book.html'>Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class='grid'>\\n      <section>\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <div class='lead'>\\n            <div class='text'>\\n              <h1>My approach to collaborative care</h1>\\n              <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>I blend structured, testable methods with attention to your context and values. Sessions balance skill practice, behavioral experiments, and reflective work so changes extend beyond the office.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style='text-align:right'>\\n              <div class='meta' style='color:var(--muted)'>Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}</div>\\n              <div style='margin-top:10px'><a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:16px'>\\n            <h2 style='font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px'>A typical course of work</h2>\\n            <div class='steps'>\\n              <div class='step'><strong>1. Initial assessment & goals</strong> — We map current difficulties and define 2–4 measurable goals.</div>\\n              <div class='step'><strong>2. Skill-building & strategies</strong> — Practical tools and in-session practice with homework to test changes.</div>\\n              <div class='step'><strong>3. Review & adapt</strong> — Regular measurement of outcomes; we shift techniques if needed.</div>\\n              <div class='step'><strong>4. Maintenance planning</strong> — Consolidation of gains and relapse strategies when appropriate.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:16px'>\\n            <h2 style='font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px'>Programs and pricing (framed differently)</h2>\\n            <p style='color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px'>I offer modular paths rather than a single fixed contract. Below are common choices; we'll tailor based on assessment.</p>\\n\\n            <div class='programs'>\\n              <div class='plan'>\\n                <div style='font-size:14px;font-weight:600'>Focused Module</div>\\n                <div class='price'>$480</div>\\n                <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Includes 6 sessions and a brief written plan. Best for discrete problems like phobias or targeted anxiety work.</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class='plan'>\\n                <div style='font-size:14px;font-weight:600'>Short Course</div>\\n                <div class='price'>$760</div>\\n                <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>10-session package focused on skills, exposures, or grief processing. Package pricing reflects prepayment and planning.</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class='disclaimer'>Fees and timelines vary; insurance reimbursement policies differ. I provide documentation to support out-of-network claims where appropriate. Fees are transparent and discussed before beginning.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:16px'>\\n            <h2 style='font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px'>Case vignette</h2>\\n            <div style='background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffd);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(7,94,85,0.04)}'>\\n              <strong>Work stress and avoidance</strong>\\n              <p class='meta'>We used a short-course package: baseline measures, graded behavioral experiments at work, and communication practice. The client reported improved concentration and fewer sick days within two months.</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style='margin-top:14px' class='card'>\\n          <h2 style='font-size:16px;margin:0 0 8px'>Common misconceptions I address</h2>\\n          <div style='margin-top:8px'>\\n            <strong>Therapy needs to be open-ended to be real</strong>\\n            <p class='meta'>Structure can make therapy more efficient. We regularly review whether the chosen path meets your goals.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style='margin-top:8px'>\\n            <strong>Talking is enough</strong>\\n            <p class='meta'>Talking helps explore meaning; change often requires experiments and practice between sessions.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class='card'>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Quick orientation</h3>\\n          <p class='meta'>Assessment calls are 15 minutes and free of charge. They clarify fit, scheduling, and mutual expectations.</p>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:12px'>\\n            <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>Schedule a consult</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <hr style='border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(7,94,85,0.05);margin:12px 0'>\\n\\n          <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Confidentiality: Records are kept securely. Exceptions to confidentiality include imminent risk of harm, suspected abuse, or court-ordered disclosure.</div>\\n\\n          <div style='margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>If you are in crisis, contact emergency services or your local crisis line. This practice is not an emergency service.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style='margin-top:12px' class='card'>\\n          <h3 style='margin:0 0 8px'>Contact</h3>\\n          <div class='meta'>Phone: {{PHONE}}</div>\\n          <div class='meta'>Email: {{EMAIL}}</div>\\n          <div style='margin-top:10px'><a class='cta' href='contact.html'>Reach out</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer style='margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between'>\\n      <div>© {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>Licensed {{LICENSE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
